  // in 8 bits, so: a windowed-sinc low-pass when resampling (no aliasing grit), normalising to the 99.95% level with a
  // soft limiter for the rare peaks above it (instead of to one loud instant, which left quiet passages ~11 of 127 steps),
  // and TPDF dither (smooth hiss instead of gritty quantisation distortion). The rate matches Butano's 21 kHz mixer.
